{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C4\", \"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\", \"C1\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C4\", \"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C1\", \"C4\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C4最均衡，既保留了内心的矛盾，又把旧感觉回来、身体想继续、过去无法回来、重新寻找理由串成了顺畅的经历；C2内容更全，但心理推演稍显繁复。keep：C2明确保留了不甘心照旧、害怕投入失去，以及不知道该往哪里走；C4次之，C3比C1更明确地保留了对现状的不甘。cover：C4按音乐的段内时序覆盖了未缓过神、强撑又想停、旧场景回来和身体先想继续几个关键原因；C2次之，C3把熟悉感觉提前放在开头，破坏了B4的先后关系。lean：C4的四个步骤各有作用，衔接紧凑；C1次之，C3把难堪单独拆成一步，C2则增加了弄清是否值得冒险、刚有把握、不敢相信判断等略显重复的心理环节。plain：C1的怕一松劲就垮下去、逼自己撑住、身体先想往前，最像一个人在讲自己的经历；C4次之，C3有些句子略显概括，C2的值得冒险、刚才的判断则比较像事后分析。另，四版都没有显式标出与Center的关系，这一点属于共同的格式缺口，不影响上述排序。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8db16534-c153-4efd-b01b-9e6093c3cdbb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T013257426426Z", "elapsed_seconds": 57.328, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:33:54.766377+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a7b69391552a2e5f64e529a31d8a37807f94e314a2f9bf8ea5492b761582e3fc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0,